            "notes": "Checks the namespaces of a Huawei OceanStor Pacific storage system via the REST API (/converged_service/namespaces endpoint). Alerts when a namespace cannot be reached, when it turned read-only, and when it reports a running status other than normal. Reports the space and the number of files every namespace uses. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy.",
